  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparedness against acute pollution - Kystverket NCA Framework Agrement for Oceans for Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this programme is to support central and local authorities in developing countries in their efforts to strengthen emergency preparedness against acute pollution in the marine environment.  The support is offered by the Norwegian Coastal Administration and partners.</narrative>
